# Only web/ is built; everything else is upload weight.
#
# Every path here is anchored with a leading slash. A bare `lib` matched
# web/lib/ as well as Foundry's, and the build failed on "@/lib/pricing" —
# the same shape as the bare `lib/` that once hid web/lib from git.
